| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| Trabajador                           | actor                                 |
| Pensionado                           | actor                                 |
| Patrón                               | organization o actor                  |
| AFORE                                | organization                          |
| AFORE receptora                      | organization-role                     |
| CONSAR                               | authority                             |
| IMSS                                 | social-security-institute             |
| ISSSTE                               | social-security-institute             |
| PENSIONISSSTE                        | pension-fund-administrator            |
| Empresa Operadora                    | industry-service-provider             |
| BDNSAR                               | information-asset o industry-registry |
